	(text_box "Attiny1616 has no native USB support, but does support protocols suchs as I2C, SPI, and UART. We use a USB to serial chip such as the CH340K. This chip has an integrated clock, built in diodes to reduce current flow back, and uses UART."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
